   SECTION 3 - ALLISON TCM PROPRIETARY (HYPOTHESIS - verify with shift sequence)
   SA 03 -> SA 05 (shift console), PGN EF00 Proprietary-A
   Bytes 7-8 carry range as ASCII chars (0x4E='N', 0x44='D', 0x52='R')
   Confirmed in trace1: 4377 frames of 0A FC 00 01 23 01 4E 4E in neutral
   ================================================================ */

