CM_ BO_ 2566834944 "[Diagnostics] PGN 0xFECB - SA assumed 0x00, edit to match your captured source address.";CM_ BO_ 2365480939 "ID 0x0CFE5FEB, PGN 0xFE5F, prio 3, SA 0xEB. Cycle 50ms +/-5ms. Daimler GPM 13, Truck->Body #1/3. THE message for the Heil interlock check: EngineSpeed + VehicleSpeed live here.";
CM_ BO_ 2566808043 "ID 0x18FE61EB, PGN 0xFE61, prio 6, SA 0xEB. Cycle 100ms +/-10ms. Daimler GPM 14, Truck->Body #1/4. CurrentGear (neutral detection) lives here.";
CM_ BO_ 2566809067 "ID 0x18FE65EB, PGN 0xFE65, prio 6, SA 0xEB. Cycle 1000ms +/-100ms. Daimler GPM 16, Truck->Body #1/6.";
CM_ BO_ 2498724075 "ID 0x14EF80EB, PGN 0xEF00 Proprietary-A PDU1, DA 0x80, prio 5, SA 0xEB. Cycle 100ms. Daimler GPM 1F (available from prod month 10.2013). Brake states + battery voltage.";
CM_ BO_ 2365481161 "ID 0x0CFE60C9, PGN 0xFE60, prio 3, SA 0xC9. Cycle 100ms. Daimler GPM 23, Body->Truck #2/3. Body requests engine speed / limits via PSM (throttle advance).";
CM_ BO_ 2498691529 "ID 0x14EF01C9, PGN 0xEF00 Proprietary-A PDU1, DA 0x01, prio 5, SA 0xC9. Cycle 100ms. Daimler GPM 2S. Body lighting/horn/door requests. Bytes 1-4 and 8 not yet defined.";
CM_ SG_ 2365480939 EngineSpeed "Actual engine speed from CPC. 0.125 rpm/bit, 0 offset. Idle ~600rpm = raw 0x12C0 (bytes appear on wire as C0 12). 0xFFFF = not available.";
CM_ SG_ 2365480939 VehicleSpeed "From tailshaft speed or tachograph. 1/256 km/h per bit. 0xFFFF = not available.";
CM_ SG_ 2365480939 DriversDemandEnginePctTorque "1%/bit, -125 offset (raw 125 = 0%).";
CM_ SG_ 2566808043 CurrentGear "1 gear/bit, offset -125. Physical 0 = NEUTRAL (raw byte = 0x7D). Negative = reverse, positive = forward, 1 = crawler. Transitions during a shift are not indicated until target gear engaged.";
CM_ SG_ 2566808043 PercentClutchSlip "Resolution not stated in Daimler excerpt; 0.4%/bit assumed per J1939 SPN 522 convention. VERIFY against live data.";
CM_ SG_ 2566808043 AccelPedalPosition "Resolution not stated in Daimler excerpt; 0.4%/bit assumed per J1939 SPN 91 convention. VERIFY against live data.";
CM_ SG_ 2566808043 TorqueConverterOilTemp "0.03125 degC/bit, -273 offset (SCA source). Allison trans temp for body use.";
CM_ SG_ 2498724075 BatteryVoltage "Resolution not stated in Daimler excerpt; 0.05 V/bit assumed per J1939 SPN 168 convention. VERIFY: ~12.8V should read raw 256 = 0x0100.";
CM_ SG_ 2498724075 ParkingBrake "CPC measured park brake state.";
CM_ SG_ 2365481161 RequestedEngineSpeed "Body (Heil) requests a target engine speed, e.g. for PTO pack cycle. 0.125 rpm/bit.";
CM_ SG_ 2365481161 ReqEngineTorqueLimit "Resolution not stated in excerpt; 1%/bit -125 offset assumed per J1939 convention.";
CM_ SG_ 2365481161 ReqVehicleSpeedLimit "Resolution not stated in excerpt; 1 km/h/bit assumed. VERIFY.";

CM_ BO_ 2565801219 "HYPOTHESIS: TCM->shift console proprietary. Bytes 7-8 ASCII range. Confirmed 0x4E=N in trace1 (4377 frames, stationary/neutral). Verify with shift sequence capture.";

CM_ BO_ 2565866755 "ETC2 from SA 03 (Allison TCM). NOT seen broadcasting on Econic backbone - may be suppressed. Entry here for non-Econic trucks.";


